Kubernetes:
Its all inclusive PaaS (Platform as a Service) system.
K8s is its short form
Kubernetes operates at container level rather than at hardware level'
Its offers -
    - Deployment, scaling, load balancing, logging, monitoring and alerts solution
K8s is not monolithic 

If application run on container, it should run on k8s
Its does not build or deploy source code
Its does not provide middleware, data-processing frameworks,db,cahes nor cluster storage systems, such componenets run on k8s


Traditional Deployment:

Apps
|
Operating system
|
Hardware


Virtualized Deployment:
- Its allow you run multiple VMs on single physical server CPU
- Application to be isolated and provides level of security, as the information of one application cannot be freely accessed by another application.
- Each VM is a full machine running all the components, including its own operating system, on top of the virtualized hardware.



